51
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:24,640
It has taken thousands of years to create the natural stores of petroleum we have

52
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:30,840
now. We are using what is available at a much faster rate than it is being produced

53
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:36,320
