peak, then production and availability will begin to seriously decline.

57
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:56,380
This is not to say there will be no petroleum at this point, but it will become very

58
00:04:56,380 --> 00:04:59,420
difficult and therefore expensive to extract.

59
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:05,020
