Welcome to Science World.

229
00:21:58,260 --> 00:21:59,760
Today we have Dr.

230
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:04,460
Michael Hudson, Chief of the Department of Life Science in Boston University.

231
00:22:04,460 --> 00:22:10,440
it is estimated that over 99 of all species that ever existed have become extinct.

232
00:22:10,900 --> 00:22:12,420
What causes extinction?

233
00:22:12,420 --> 00:22:18,840
Well, when a species is no longer adapted to a changed environment, it may perish.

234
00:22:19,340 --> 00:22:23,840
The exact causes of a species' death vary from situation to situation.

235
00:22:23,840 --> 00:22:28,980
addition, rapid ecological change may render an environment hostile to a species.

236
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:34,660
For example, temperatures may change and a species may not be able to adapt.

237
00:22:34,660 --> 00:22:40,500
Food resources may be affected by environmental changes, which will then cause

238
00:22:40,500 --> 00:22:43,740
